{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/extras/\ud5e4\ub3541.png?t=1742346834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Aria was a cherished companion and lover.She died suddenly during an adventure.To atone for not being able to protect her, the protagonist wants to fulfill her wish: collect hatsukka flowers to express his gratitude!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/extras/1111111.png?t=1742346834\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make her dreams come true</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel around town, looking for people who need help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They need help fighting monsters, finding things, solving problems, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help them and collect Hatsuka flowers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/extras/222222.png?t=1742346834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use different combinations to defeat enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Party members come in a variety of classes, including warriors, rogues, mages, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit party members from all over town and build your favorite combinations to take down your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a variety of attributes, such as fire, electricity, and darkness, that you can use to give you an advantage in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/extras/\ub179\ud654_2025_03_12_22_34_55_601.gif?t=1742346834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A big world to explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ice caves, slime forests, ruins, underground caverns, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for adventure, explore, and immerse yourself in Hatsuka's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/extras/\ub179\ud654_2025_03_12_22_34_11_103.gif?t=1742346834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575960?t=1742346834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575960?t=1742346834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/28371abd93865c53ddc7ee2414f65f0ab489f0e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742346834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/28371abd93865c53ddc7ee2414f65f0ab489f0e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742346834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/extras/\ud5e4\ub3541.png?t=1742346834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Aria was a cherished companion and lover.She died suddenly during an adventure.To atone for not being able to protect her, the protagonist wants to fulfill her wish: collect hatsukka flowers to express his gratitude!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575960/extras/1